# KnucklsOS MINIMAL package list (step 1: prove it boots on real PC).
# Just a KDE desktop + Ubuntu's live-boot (casper). No gaming/branding yet.
kde-plasma-desktop
sddm
casper
lupin-casper
plasma-nm
dolphin
konsole
breeze
kdeconnect
# Firmware: Ubuntu's linux-image-generic pulls linux-firmware automatically,
# so Intel/AMD GPU + wifi firmware is present by default (fixes laptop black screen).
linux-firmware
intel-microcode
amd64-microcode
# Basic utils
curl
wget
ca-certificates
network-manager
